# Trivy suppressions (SR-4.4). One CVE ID per line, and every line requires a
# comment with: justification, linked ticket/decision, and expiry date.
# Suppressions without an expiry are rejected in review.
# Example:
# CVE-2024-00000 # accepted-risk: false positive in distroless glibc; ticket SEC-123; expires 2026-11-01
